# HTTPS_CERTIFICATE=files — a certificate you already have.
#
# From your IT department's own certificate authority, or one you bought.
# Put the certificate (with its chain) and its private key in ./volumes/certs
# on the host, named exactly:
#
#   volumes/certs/cert.pem   (beside volumes/caddy-windows)
#   volumes/certs/key.pem
#
# Caddy does not renew these; replace the files and restart the GoalGetterHTTPS
# Windows service (Restart-Service GoalGetterHTTPS) before they expire.
tls {$FRONT_DOOR_DATA}/../certs/cert.pem {$FRONT_DOOR_DATA}/../certs/key.pem
